id: pm-vf9iaf
title: SDK complete-list receipt falsely reports legacy aliases for canonical helper
description: listAllComplete() certifies the corpus but its read_output receipt attributes internal compatibility fields to the caller and emits unusable migration hints.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[4]: agent-ux,gh-1315,read-output,sdk
