completed_at: "2026-09-26T15:43:47.397Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Correct SDK receipt provenance without changing certified completeness or genuine caller alias tracking; add a published SDK regression test and verify CLI parity.
parent: pm-y4aaol
repro_steps: "See https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1315 for disposable-tracker reproduction."
resolution: "SDK-generated complete-list options carry private canonical provenance through normalization, suppressing false legacy alias hints while preserving explicit SDK and CLI alias reporting. Added public SDK regression and kept narrow SDK imports lightweight."
expected_result: listAllComplete certifies the whole corpus and reports no caller legacy aliases or migration hints; explicit aliases remain visible.
actual_result: Sandboxed SDK integration and temporary packed npm/Bun consumers passed with clean canonical receipts; explicit SDK and CLI alias assertions passed.
affected_version: 2026.9.26
component: src/sdk/query
